NAME
    gcloud apihub attributes - manage Attribute resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub attributes COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Attribute resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create an Attribute.

     delete
        Delete an Attribute.

     describe
        Describe an Attribute.

     list
        List Attributes.

     update
        Update an Attribute.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub attributes

